{"ticker":"TMO","updated":"2026-11-27T23:25:39Z","profile":{"longName":"Thermo Fisher Scientific Inc.","shortName":"Thermo Fisher Scientific Inc","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Diagnostics & Research","country":"United States","website":"https://www.thermofisher.com","fullTimeEmployees":125000,"marketCap":253077159936,"trailingPE":36.02532,"forwardPE":24.584684,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":5.3447056,"pegRatio":16.98,"targetMeanPrice":755.1223,"targetHighPrice":830.0,"targetLowPrice":590.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":26,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.091,"earningsGrowth":0.087,"grossMargins":0.41259998,"operatingMargins":0.19062,"profitMargins":0.14935,"totalRevenue":47351001088,"beta":0.845,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":727.56,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":435.27,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.27},"summary":"Thermo Fisher Scientific Inc. provides life sciences solutions, analytical instruments, specialty diagnostics, and laboratory products and biopharma services internationally. It operates through four segments: Life Sciences Solutions, Analytical Instruments, Specialty Diagnostics, and Laboratory Products and Biopharma Services. The Life Sciences Solutions segment includes reagents, instruments, and consumables for biological and medical research; discovery and production of drugs and vaccines; and diagnosis of infections and diseases. Its Analytical Instruments segment provides instruments, consumables, software, and services for pharmaceutical, biotechnology, academic, government, environmental, and other research and industrial markets, as well as clinical laboratories. The Specialty Diagnostics segment offers clinical diagnostics products, such as liquid ready-to-use and lyophilized immunodiagnostic reagent kits, calibrators, controls, protein detection assays, and instruments; immunodiagnostic offerings comprising developing, manufacturing, and marketing of complete blood-test systems for the clinical diagnosis and monitoring of allergy, asthma and autoimmune diseases; microbiology offerings, such as dehydrated and prepared culture media, collection and transport systems, instrumentation and consumables to detect pathogens in blood, diagnostic and rapid direct specimen test","summary_zh":"Thermo Fisher Scientific Inc. 在全球範圍內提供生命科學解決方案、分析儀器、專業診斷、實驗室產品和生物製藥服務。它透過四個部門運作：生命科學解決方案、分析儀器、專業診斷、實驗室產品和生物製藥服務。生命科學解決方案部門包括用於生物和醫學研究的試劑、儀器和消耗品；藥物和疫苗的發現和生產；以及感染和疾病的診斷。其分析儀器部門為製藥、生物技術、學術、政府、環境和其他研究和工業市場以及臨床實驗室提供儀器、耗材、軟體和服務。專業診斷部門提供臨床診斷產品，例如液體即用型和凍乾免疫診斷試劑盒、校準品、對照品、蛋白質檢測分析和儀器；免疫診斷產品，包括開發、製造和營銷用於臨床診斷和監測過敏、哮喘和自身免疫性疾病的完整血液檢測系統；微生物學產品，例如脫水和製備的培養基、收集和運輸系統、檢測血液中病原體的儀器和耗材、診斷和快速直接樣本測試","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"診斷與研究","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":466.84,"h":467.35,"l":456.67,"c":462.04,"v":3018300},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":464.12,"h":486.25,"l":460.0,"c":485.02,"v":4363900},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":487.0,"h":534.9,"l":486.94,"c":530.73,"v":6092700},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":525.71,"h":539.9,"l":523.0,"c":524.96,"v":3262000},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":525.36,"h":545.44,"l":525.36,"c":543.32,"v":3048500},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":540.0,"h":545.86,"l":536.46,"c":543.95,"v":2560100},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":542.68,"h":549.44,"l":538.34,"c":539.17,"v":1870800},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":538.13,"h":549.26,"l":535.63,"c":536.19,"v":2153200},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":533.74,"h":537.57,"l":528.84,"c":534.68,"v":1830700},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":534.83,"h":537.93,"l":523.65,"c":524.8,"v":1415800},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":527.53,"h":530.83,"l":523.89,"c":524.58,"v":1686600},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":521.74,"h":529.85,"l":519.45,"c":525.83,"v":1601000},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":524.91,"h":532.41,"l":522.42,"c":527.87,"v":1430400},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":544.36,"h":544.6,"l":534.16,"c":536.78,"v":2115900},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":534.16,"h":540.87,"l":532.0,"c":538.92,"v":2010200},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":541.0,"h":550.46,"l":540.0,"c":543.84,"v":1665200},{"t":"2025-10-21","o":559.08,"h":568.39,"l":553.74,"c":557.99,"v":3932400},{"t":"2025-10-22","o":555.5,